{"parentUuid":"5ddefe77-89f3-4a78-88fd-389413c740ce","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ad3b5c11f3a618bca","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NcsjxaiEWNPsJvnC5szZz8","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca\n06e5664 cursor: stop-block-continuation unsupported, recorded in runs/stop-block-continuation (#94)\n8b0dec5 codex, cursor: schedule-wakeup unsupported, recorded in runs/schedule-wakeup-ask (#93)\nfca6d74 capabilities: empty-tool-result-placeholder unsupported on codex and cursor, shown by shell-exit-status runs (#92)\nstatement: >-\n  A machine-readable run stream announces each background task and sub-agent\n  when it starts, updates its status, and reports its end with a notification.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/typescript#sdktaskstartedmessage\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/typescript#sdktaskupdatedmessage\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/typescript#sdktasknotificationmessage\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgbash\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/midturn\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgagent\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/meta\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hookerrors\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/cap-sub\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\ncommit f860ff366b50328d62a3ff06a1cd76d39e84245f\nAuthor: Mykyta Svyrydenko <<redacted-email>>\nDate:   Sat Oct 3 16:44:15 2026 +0200\n\n    codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\n    \n    Codex tells the agent a failed command's output like a success's; the failure is only in the event stream's command_execution item (status failed, exit_code). Recorded with the real codex; the cell lists that as a deviation, and the mock does the same.\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/shell_result_test.go      | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n codex-mock/internal/events/stream.go               |  7 ++-\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/run.yaml      |  2 +\n .../shell-exit-status/samples/20261003-142833/SEAL |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/events.jsonl           | 22 +++++++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/exit.txt               |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/payloads.jsonl         |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stderr.txt             |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stream.jsonl           | 16 +++++\n ...8-34-01a1022a-acf2-7e12-9814-d1750d3ff095.jsonl | 28 +++++++++\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/setup/hook.sh |  5 ++\n .../runs/shell-exit-status/setup/hooks.json        | 24 ++++++++\n .../runs/shell-exit-status/setup/prompt.txt        |  1 +\n spec/capabilities/bash-tool-result.yaml            | 16 ++++-\n 14 files changed, 204 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\ncapability-grounding\ncapability-once\nchild-processes\nfile-size\nlayering\nmock-config\nmodeled-surface\nmodules-cover-code\nstructured-files\nCLA.md\nCONTRIBUTING.md\nLICENSE\nREADME.md\nadr\nclaude-mock\ncodex-mock\ncursor-mock\ngo.mod\ngo.sum\ninternal\nproposals\nspec\ntools","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d22554f9-bbdb-4f98-bdab-e72c6b9f50f8","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:14:58.705Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5ddefe77-89f3-4a78-88fd-389413c740ce","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a26fb63d519ffd330"}
