{"parentUuid":"8698e225-032f-49b8-9696-01ec580ac2e3","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ad3b5c11f3a618bca","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffZFypyCfYf1p4Sa5xuo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`sr-checks` is still running, so nothing is merged or pushed yet. It is slow, probably because other agents' checks are running at the same time. I'm waiting on it before I push, open the PR and merge.\n\nWhat is done so far, committed and rebased on `origin/main`:\n\n- **Codex (`task-stream-frames`):**\n  - Cell: supported. It cites the new `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/task-stream-frames` run and the `noninteractive#make-output-machine-readable` doc.\n  - Recorded behaviour: a sub-agent is announced by the `spawn_agent` item. Its status and end show up in the `wait` item.\n  - Deviations: Codex has no task frames and a shell command is never a task. The mock has a script-supplied sub-agent reply and fires no hooks for these calls.\n- **Cursor (`task-stream-frames`):**\n  - Cell: supported. It cites the new `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/task-stream-frames` run and the `cli/headless#real-time-progress-tracking` doc.\n  - Recorded behaviour: tasks are announced by their `tool_call` frames. A background command's end is a `task_notification` frame.\n  - Deviations: Cursor has no `task_started` or `task_updated` frame and no notification for a sub-agent. The mock has a script-supplied reply and fires no hooks for these calls.\n- **Mock code:** both adapters use the shared `internal/tasks` code and carry `sr:provides` markers. Each has a new test marked `sr:proves`.\n  - Shared module: I added `cursor-mock/internal/runner/background*.go` and `codex-mock/internal/runner/background*.go` to the `internal/tasks/module.yaml` home so the new files have a module.\n  - Edited files with other capabilities' markers: one-line edits to `host.go` and `run.go` in the cursor runner, and to `turn_host.go` and `run.go` in the codex runner. The judges may re-judge those files.\n- **Local checks:** build, vet, gofmt, and the codex tests, the `internal` tests and my new cursor test pass. One existing cursor timing test, `TestATimedOutHookThatFailsClosedBlocksTheCommand`, failed once on a timing assertion while other agents were loading the machine. I have not re-run it.\n\nI'll report the PR number and merge status once the checks finish."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":210,"cache_read_input_tokens":177295,"output_tokens":899,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":102},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":210},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":899,"cache_read_input_tokens":177295,"cache_creation_input_tokens":210,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":210,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CffZFyXMZrLYqas9gmWpk","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"4f1fa62a-a315-435e-880f-d3a7d42c399d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:41:09.132Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a7e54ea3099505a7e"}
