{"parentUuid":"617b3595-d342-476c-abcb-d35c23b2d339","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ad3b5c11f3a618bca","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HYmE37RxkKzT6bw1YJko7S","type":"tool_result","content":"696edd7 rules: a doc re-freeze or an edited declaration touches only the capabilities whose judges read it (#108)\n0d57483 codex: subagent-lifecycle-hooks supported; cursor: unsupported (#106)\n809d9c0 codex, cursor: task-notifications (codex unsupported, cursor supported), recorded in runs/task-notifications-* (#105)\nc3be394 codex, cursor: agent-input-validation cells supported, recorded with the real harnesses (#104)\n3cc192a codex, cursor: session-resume-unknown cells (codex supported with deviations, cursor unsupported) (#103)\ncommit 696edd74bd2fdfaf6bb377ff0c7358a30fd9f39d\nAuthor: Mykyta Svyrydenko <<redacted-email>>\nDate:   Sat Oct 3 18:48:09 2026 +0200\n\n    rules: a doc re-freeze or an edited declaration touches only the capabilities whose judges read it (#108)\n    \n    capability-grounded and capability-rigor took every capability of a harness when its MANIFEST changed, and every marker in a file when the file changed. Now a MANIFEST change touches the capabilities citing a page whose entry changed (all of a harness's when its version moved), and a file change touches the pairs whose marker sits on a changed declaration (all when the file is added, deleted or renamed). A verdict's key carries the frozen hash of each page it reads and the harness version in place of the whole MANIFEST, so nothing is reused stale. touched.sh holds the helpers; the subject tests cover both.\n    \n    Sloprail-Cites-User: narrow the subjects so a MANIFEST or shared-file change only re-judges the capabilities whose judges actually read the changed doc entry or file\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n .sloprail/_lib/touched.sh                          | 118 +++++++++++++++++++++\n .../file-guard/capability-grounded/prepare.sh      |   6 +-\n .../file-guard/capability-grounded/subjects.sh     |  29 +++--\n .sloprail/file-guard/capability-rigor/pairs-lib.sh |  17 +--\n .sloprail/file-guard/capability-rigor/subjects.sh  |  19 ++--\n .sloprail/tests/subjects.sh                        |  37 +++++++\n 6 files changed, 199 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)\ncodex-mock/internal/events/collab.go\ncodex-mock/internal/runner/agent_host.go","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8be24622-a1ed-4118-943c-f0a91ccd22a4","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:49:24.857Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"617b3595-d342-476c-abcb-d35c23b2d339","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
