{"parentUuid":"a12929c0-0e4e-4ef7-a701-1d885f33cbee","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ad3b5c11f3a618bca","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0162XYEnhwzGUYRVDDLdsfEv","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca/cursor-mock/internal/runner/background.go has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"652e41fb-7300-4fe0-ac1c-35e8a11bc809","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:51:41.931Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a12929c0-0e4e-4ef7-a701-1d885f33cbee","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
{"parentUuid":"a73c77f7-92bc-45f5-8b55-2164d92b3ddd","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ad3b5c11f3a618bca","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mpn2i55wtxDhnmkuRk4T2p","type":"tool_result","content":"    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/noninteractive#make-output-machine-readable\n    runs:\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/task-stream-frames\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          Codex's event stream has no task frames: no start, update or\n          notification frame of its own, and a shell command is never a task\n          (a command started \"in the background\" ran as an ordinary\n          command_execution item). Only a sub-agent is announced, by the\n          collab_tool_call item of the spawn_agent call (started, then\n          completed naming the sub-agent's thread, its state pending_init), and\n          its status and end are told only in the item completing a wait on it,\n          as its state (\"completed\") with its answer as the message (recorded:\n          runs/task-stream-frames). The mock does the same.\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          The mock runs no model, so a sub-agent's answer is the one the\n          scenario script gives in the spawn call, and neither spawn_agent nor\n          wait_agent fires hooks, where Codex fires PostToolUse for them.\n  cursor:\n    docs:\n      - https://cursor.com/docs/cli/headless#real-time-progress-tracking\n    runs:\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/task-stream-frames\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          Cursor's stream-json has no task_started or task_updated frame: a\n          sub-agent and a background command are announced by the tool_call\n          frames of the call that launched them (taskToolCall started, then\n          completed with the sub-agent's final reply; shellToolCall completed\n          at once with isBackground and the task's shellId), and only the end\n          of a background command is a frame of its own, a system\n          task_notification frame with the task's id, a status (\"success\" when\n          it exited 0) and its title, which follows the awaitToolCall that\n          waited for it (recorded: runs/task-stream-frames). A sub-agent has no\n          notification frame. The mock does the same.\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          The mock runs no model, so a sub-agent's reply is the one the\n          scenario script gives in the Task call. The Task, background Shell and\n          Await calls fire no hooks, where Cursor fires preToolUse (and\n          postToolUse for the Shell) for them, and a status other than a command's exit 0, a\n          background command that is never awaited, and a timeout of the\n          await are not modelled: the recording shows none of them.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"35eafcfe-0e7f-4fdc-be3d-9b3d91a8a460","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:51:45.601Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a73c77f7-92bc-45f5-8b55-2164d92b3ddd","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
