{"parentUuid":"574dbd88-b9b3-498c-8864-8e5b3c6a3e00","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ad3b5c11f3a618bca","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfffcFLPCtECsA4Z1YNvp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both pending cells for `task-stream-frames` are resolved as supported with deviations, and PR #110 is squash-merged to `main` with every check green.\n\n- **codex: supported.**\n  - Run: I recorded `runs/task-stream-frames`. Codex announces a sub-agent with the `spawn_agent` `collab_tool_call` item, and its status and end appear in the `wait` item.\n  - Deviation: Codex has no task frames and a shell command is never a task, so the cell declares that.\n  - Mock: after the rebase, the mock reuses the `spawn_agent` path from #106. I deleted my own adapter and put an `sr:provides task-stream-frames/codex` marker on `CollabCompleted` in `events/collab.go`. A new e2e test, `collab_test.go`, covers it.\n- **cursor: supported.**\n  - Run: I recorded `runs/task-stream-frames`. Cursor announces tasks by their `tool_call` frames. A background command ends with a system `task_notification` frame.\n  - Deviation: Cursor has no `task_started` or `task_updated` frame, and a sub-agent gets no notification frame. The cell also declares that the mock answers a `Task` call as an error, because it models no sub-agents. It has no `Await` tool either, so the notification follows the turn's end where the recording shows it after the await.\n  - Mock: the mock reuses the existing background-shell and notification code, with an `sr:provides task-stream-frames/cursor` marker on `notificationFrame` in `background.go`. A new e2e test, `task_frames_test.go`, covers it.\n- **Reply key:** the `reply` key and my own adapters are gone, and I did not need to write `adr/scripted-subagents`.\n- **Verification:** `sr-checks` printed no refusals after the rebase. I did not touch `run.go`, `turn_host.go` or `host.go`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":175,"cache_read_input_tokens":227454,"output_tokens":632,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":175},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":632,"cache_read_input_tokens":227454,"cache_creation_input_tokens":175,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":175,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfffcF4mDp2TvgP2UZMfX","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"79861d90-9f4a-43ca-afb1-7bf64c4cd084","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:04:22.452Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ad3b5c11f3a618bca","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a11c0a040e3cf682b"}
